Phase 0–11 completion audit follow-up — 2026-10-12 05:45 UTC:

- Linux ARM64 `cargo test --workspace --locked` exposed two order/timing assumptions in existing Phase 3 remoting tests. The NameServer test sorted observed dynamic ports but compared them with allocation order; the async callback test read the context channel before the immediately-following success callback had appended its event. Both test assertions now compare sorted values / wait with a bounded timeout. The complete Linux ARM64 workspace suite then passed; no production remoting code changed.
